        "original_id": "e0addf3b-2e0d-5fd2-9300-1415ebfdc5f4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carl Barât, Jesse Michaels, Peter Doherty\n- Bands: The Libertines, Dirty Pretty Things, The Jackals, Operation Ivy, Big Rig\n- Places: Berkeley, California, San Francisco Bay Area\n- Roles: musician, co-frontman, frontman, lead guitarist, songwriter, vocalist, guitarist, artist\n\nFacts:\n- Carl Barât was born on 6 June 1978 and is a British musician.\n- Carl Barât is best known as the co-frontman of The Libertines with Peter Doherty.\n- Carl Barât was the frontman and lead guitarist of Dirty Pretty Things.\n- Carl Barât debuted a solo album in 2010.\n- Carl Barât announced the creation of his new band The Jackals in 2014.\n- Jesse Michaels is a songwriter, vocalist, guitarist, and artist from Berkeley, California.\n- Jesse Michaels is best known as the vocalist for the ska punk band Operation Ivy.\n- Big Rig was a punk band from the San Francisco Bay Area fronted by singer-songwriter Jesse Michaels.",
